#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_anomaly.md:5
msgid ""
"Tabular anomaly detection with a CleanEnergyQVAE: the Q-VAE latent model "
"is extended with a free-energy scoring head and an NCE-style contrastive "
"objective, so normal samples get lower free energy and anomalies get "
"higher free energy. Covers threshold search (best-F1 over a candidate "
"grid) and PR/ROC / score-distribution / t-SNE evaluation."
msgstr ""

